  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a continuation of previous support to ombudsman in Peru. This is a 4 year agreement. Swedish support contains: 1) The activities at regional offices in Huancayo and Ayuacucho including integration of previous PPPAV and secuelas programmes; 2) a new unit at HQ to address the consequencies of the violance and 3) support to  administrative unit at HQ to improve planning and follow-up processes</narrative>
  </description>
